      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums3F_Text_GatheredUpBerries",
      "en_US": [
        "I gathered up a lot of Berries, so\n",
        "I’m trading them in for Accessories.\r",
        "Next stop, Hearthome City!\n",
        "I’m taking the Contest challenge!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "J’ai ramassé plein de Baies, du coup je\n",
        "les échange contre des Accessoires.\r",
        "Prochain arrêt: Unionpolis!\n",
        "Je vais tenter ma chance au Concours!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityCondominiums3F_Text_BadgesFromGymsOrContestWins",
      "en_US": [
        "Badges from Gyms, or Contest wins...\n",
        "There’s more than just one way to\r",
        "be a winner, it seems.\n",
        "Here’s hoping you’ll find something\r",
        "in which you can be the victor."
